{"duration": 32.73, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.9, "text": "In False Bay the change went further.\nSeal Island there was once famous"}, {"start": 5.9, "end": 11.22, "text": "for great whites leaping clear of the\nwater after seals. Shark scientist"}, {"start": 11.22, "end": 15.82, "text": "Neil Hammerschlag and his team have\nsurveyed the island since 2000."}, {"start": 15.82, "end": 20.41, "text": "Their boats recorded no great\nwhites after August 2018."}, {"start": 21.11, "end": 26.47, "text": "On the beaches of Cape Town, shark\nspotters logged more than 300"}, {"start": 26.47, "end": 32.73, "text": "great white sightings in 2011.\nBy 2019 they were logging none."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.2, "text": "In"}, {"start": 0.2, "end": 0.58, "text": "False"}, {"start": 0.58, "end": 1.0, "text": "Bay"}, {"start": 1.42, "end": 1.5, "text": "the"}, {"start": 1.5, "end": 1.96, "text": "change"}, {"start": 1.96, "end": 2.32, "text": "went"}, {"start": 2.32, "end": 3.0, "text": "further."}, {"start": 3.9, "end": 3.9, "text": "Seal"}, {"start": 3.9, "end": 4.4, "text": "Island"}, {"start": 4.76, "end": 4.94, "text": "there"}, {"start": 4.94, "end": 5.08, "text": "was"}, {"start": 5.08, "end": 5.38, "text": "once"}, {"start": 5.38, "end": 5.9, "text": "famous"}, {"start": 5.9, "end": 6.28, "text": "for"}, {"start": 6.28, "end": 6.54, "text": "great"}, {"start": 6.54, "end": 6.96, "text": "whites"}, {"start": 6.96, "end": 7.26, "text": "leaping"}, {"start": 7.26, "end": 7.72, "text": "clear"}, {"start": 7.72, "end": 7.9, "text": "of"}, {"start": 7.9, "end": 8.02, "text": "the"}, {"start": 8.02, "end": 8.36, "text": "water"}, {"start": 8.36, "end": 8.76, "text": "after"}, {"start": 8.76, "end": 9.16, "text": "seals."}, {"start": 10.26, "end": 10.26, "text": "Shark"}, {"start": 10.26, "end": 10.94, "text": "scientist"}, {"start": 11.22, "end": 11.3, "text": "Neil"}, {"start": 11.3, "end": 12.16, "text": "Hammerschlag"}, {"start": 12.16, "end": 12.36, "text": "and"